<h2>Perbedaan Besi Galvanis dan Besi Hollow Biasa</h2>
<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-7303" src="/assets/blog/besi-galvanis-dan-besi-hollow.jpg" alt="" width="1000" height="700" /></p>
